 is full of trash. Please help me clean it up."Are you okay?!"YThe Trubbish must've been attracted by your smell from picking up all of this trash!"JWow, the beach looks much nicer now. Thank you so much for your help!"jHere, I want you to have this for helping me out! It was buried under some of the debris you cleaned."(I challenged the Gym Leader, but..."fI thought that bringing in a Grass and Water-type Pokémon would make quick work of Rock types..."_But Fusions make it possible to counter every weakness, you can never know what to expect!"o\PN, you just moved here so you might not know this, but \C[1]Mr. Briney\C[0] was once a revered seafarer."kOh, me? I'm just taking a little break here and enjoying the city before I go on to challenge Roxanne."gI went to the clothing store to find a hat, but I couldn't make up my mind about which one to get!"LI have an idea! Do you wanna trade your hat for mine? Just for funsies!"GThanks! This looks neat. You really do have a good sense of style!"mOh well, it was just an idea, never mind then... By the way, have you noticed how cool this fountain is?"KOh, you know what could be fun? Go get yourself a hat and we'll trade!"8This fountain really is something, don't you think?"2<b><fs=34>Out of the way!\. Move it!</fs></b>"Wait! Pleeeaaase!"Don't take those parts!"FWe're fusing both of our Pokémon together to make them stronger!"#The Pokémon Trainer school..."JIf I go to this school, will I be able to catch rare Pokémon easily?"3Oh! How did it go? Did you get my Devon Parts?" You did! You got them back!")Do you know about Devon Corporation?"OWe're only Hoenn's largest tech company! And I'm its president, Mr. Stone!"G...Oh, this is no place to talk. Please come with me to my office!">Where does the extra Pokéball go when you fuse Pokémon?"6You gotta be careful when you're out in the wild."UIf you get attacked by multiple Pokémon, you'll have to fight them all at once!"MThey say that if you throw a coin in a fountain, you get to