web instead of working!">It's an in-depth Wiki about Pokémon Fusion. Have a look?"'Devon Corporation: A Brief History"jDevon Corporation was initially founded by Mr. Stone as a mining company operating in northern Hoenn."eIt was Mr. Stone's love for fossils and minerals that made the company grow into what it is now."�The company rapidly diversified their operations into researching new technologies and is now considered the most influential company in Hoenn."#<o=100><fs=16>Whee...</fs></o>"2<fs=32><outln2><b>SQUAWK!!!!</b></outln></fs>"NMr. Stone found a Lileep fossil while digging in his backyard as a child."rThis is what gave him his love for Pokémon fossils and inspired him to found this company later in his life."mThere's a lot to learn about Pokémon fusion! You can look up what you need on the classroom's computer."kI have a lot of questions about our wonderful Hoenn Region, and it seems a lot of others have as well."5Thankfully, this book contains loads of answers!"DHuh? What's that, Whismur? Are you trying to tell me something?"#Ugh... I can't hear a thing..."CWhismur's whispers are so soft, I can barely hear them at all!"\It's not its fault, of course, but maybe I should fuse it with something that's louder."WOh! What about a \C[1]Wingull\C[0]? They're pretty loud, so it should average out."(Do you think you could find me one?"3Maybe that's not such a good idea after all..."CHey! Did you find a \C[1]Wingull\C[0] to fuse with my Whismur?"mIf I fuse Whismur with something loud like a Wingull, I should be able to hear what it wants to tell me!"!\PN handed over the Wingull."Okay, Whismur. Here we go!"<b>Squawk!</b>",It worked, I can hear it perfectly now!"8Now, what is it that you've been trying to tell me?""<b>Squawk squawk! Squawk!</b>"Oh! I get it now!"PYou want the \C[1]Rare Candies\C[0] I was keeping in the fridge! Of course!"&Here you go, little buddy. Enjoy!"Uhh...."Oh my...":<fs=32><outln2><b>SQUAWK SQUAWK!!!! </b></outln></fs>""Oh no, this is much too loud!"6I need to get some earplugs! This was a bad idea!"1Please, take this last \C[1]Rare Candy\C[0]!"9I hope my neighbours don't file a noise complaint..."$There's an email on the screen:"�"The preliminary analysis on the meteorite you sent me shows that it emits powerful fusion energy, equal to thousands of DNA Splicers, maybe more.""�"This could be very dangerous if it fell in the wrong hands. I will need to keep it here in Fallarbor Town a bit longer for further analysis."\n- Professor Cozmo"ZIt's an in-depth book containing frequently asked questions about Hoenn. Have a look?"9Huh? Oh, I'm sorry. This area is for employees only."Piuhh!"nIt's tapping it's wand against the blackboard, seemingly wanting you to read what's written on the board."'We learned about evolutions today!"RDid you know that fused Pokémon evolve at the same time as unfused Pokémon?"FI specialize in restoring Pokémon fossils to their former glory."*If you have a fossil, bring it to me!"=Let me know when you want us to revive a fossil for you."ROh, I'm sorry, but our fossil reviving machine cannot extract DNA from amber."qYou'll have to go to a more sophisticated laboratory for that, like the one in Cinnabar Island for instance."/Okay. I'll see if I can revive your \v[3]."<Come back around \V[85]:00. It should be ready by then."}Oh \PN, I'm so sorry to have to tell you that, but your fossil has been irreversably damaged during the reviving fossil."NUnfortunately, it doesn't look like there is any chance of recovering it.">Where have you been? We've finished reviving your fossil."'It was \v[3], just like I thought."RYou have no room left. Use the PC over there to make some room and come back!"5It'll take a little while to revive your fossil.">Come back at about \V[85]:00. It should be ready by then."CThere's just too many combinations. I can't remember them all!"RI heard there's a secret clearing with rare Pokémon deep in Petalburg woods."I just have to find it!"
Meoh!"oI can't identify this new fossil I found. It looks a bit like a dome, but it's also shaped like a helix..."`Could it be the fossil of a Kabuto and Omanyte fusion? Huh, I don't know if that's right..."KSome wild Pokémon will shy away or freeze up when they see a trainer."TOthers are curious and will come closer to investigate, or even charge at them!"PA detailed book all about fossil identification. It seems very complicated."�Attack, Defense and Speed are the \C[1]Physical stats\C[0]. They are passed down more effectively in fusions by the \C[1]Body Pokémon\C[0]."�Special Attack, Special Defense and HP are the \C[1]Special stats\C[0]. They are passed down more effectively in fusions by the \C[1]Head Pokémon\C[0]."YWhat were these Pokémon thinking... Why would they want to fuse together like this?"1Oh, hi. I do research on Pokémon behaviors."�I'm trying to get a better understanding of what pushes wild Pokémon to fuse together in the wild, but I don't have enough data."zI've caught a glimpse of it once. Two Pokémon attacked me at once, but just before battling me, they fused together!"vWas it a conscious decision? An involuntary reflex? That's what I'm trying to figure out... But I need more data!"jCould you please go out and see if you can get wild Pokémon to fuse together before they battle you?"tExcellent! To make sure that I have enough data, we would need to see it happen \C[1]at least three times\C[0]."(Now go and gather some data for me!"b\C[2]NOTICE: This quest can only be completed with the "Overworld Encounters" option enabled."&Are you back from gathering data?"SWow! It happened the same way each time. This confirms that it wasn't a fluke!"]I see... Maybe the Pokémon felt the need to fuse together because they felt threatened?"sThere's still much to learn, but I feel like I'm getting a better understanding of how Pokémon think already."&Thank you! Here's for helping me."yI've caught a glimpse of it once. Two Pokémon attacked me at once but just before battling me, they fused together!"`Please go out and see if you can get wild Pokémon to fuse together before they battle you."NWe would need to see it happen three different times to have enough data."5Devon Corp develops all kinds of new technology!"IMy dream is to create a device that allows us to talk with Pokémon."JUnderstanding Pokémon behavior is a large part of catching Pokémon!"LStudents who don't study get a little taste of my \C[1]Quick Claw\C[0]."ZWhether or not you are a good student will be evident from the way you use this item."fA Pokémon holding the Quick Claw will occasionally speed up and get to move before its opponent."FThere are many other items that are meant to be held by Pokémon."9Just those alone will give you many topics to study."YA fusion can learn all of the moves of both its Body Pokémon and its Head Pokémon."	Mah!"(Clefairy is tapping the blackboard!"Piuh piuh!"Piuh piuh piuh!!!"0Clefairy reached out to hand you something."Piuh..."DFusions inherit the ability of either one of its base Pokémon."[I hear that Mr. Stone, the president of Devon Corp. is obsessed with Pokémon Fossils!""Heya! Do you have a PokéNav?"KI've been working on this app for it. Here, let me install it for you!"RIt's a music app! Use it to listen to your favorite tracks wherever you want!"SWhat do you think of the Jukebox App on your PokéNav? Have you been using it?"Yes"NoIu;␀([[$"What do you want?"(Can't you see we're busy? Get lost!"!I'm working, leave me alone!"aThe beach, the fresh air... This city reminds me a lot of Cianwood City in my home region..."lI'm an adventurer from the \C[1]Johto region\C[0]. I came here while on a journey to explore the world!":Let's battle! I want to see how local trainers fight!"NWoah! You have a different style compared to the trainers where I'm from!"6Okay, I'll give you this hat from my home region!"�Actually, I have an idea! I brought way too many clothes from home and it's weighing me down, and I underestimated