el procedure, we can safely extract battle experience that you've obtained with your Pokémon into condensed \C[1]Exp. Candies\C[0]!"CIt's a safe way to transfer Exp. from one Pokémon to another!"{The cost is $1000, with an additional fee of $500 per Exp. Candy that gets extracted. Would you like to give it a try?"5Which Pokémon do you want to extract Exp. from?"Come back anytime!"AVery well, I'll take your \V[3]. It'll just be a little bit."kThe extraction was a success! Here's your Pokémon back, with all of the Exp. Candies we've extracted."$Feel free to come back anytime!"OThe Mauville tunnels sure are useful to protect yourself from bad weather!""Hi! Welcome to Mauville City!"IWould you like to know about the different things to do in the city?"&Enjoy your stay in Mauville City!"4So this is where they film the news, huh? Cool!"dIt's a picture of a building in Lavender Town. You can see the famous Pokémon Tower behind it!".Is this your first time in Mauville City?"ZThe city is connected underground through tunnels. They make it easy to get anywhere!"VA poster for the upcoming second season of "The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force"!")Hi! We sell furniture and souvenirs!"O... But we're currently waiting on a new shipment. We're all out of stock."oWe give away shirts to Pokémon Trainers. Come and see me if you catch a lot of Pokémon of the same type!">Well, well, what have we here? A most energetic customer!"AMe? You can call me Rydel. I'm the owner of this cycle shop."NYour running shoes, they're awfully filthy... Did you come from far away?"Hm, hm..."DYou came all the way from Littleroot?! That's ridiculously far!"5Hm, hm... Have you been stepping in mud or what?"cIf you had one of my bikes, you could go anywhere while feeling the gentle caress of the wind!".I'll tell you what, I'll give you a bike!">If you go fast enough on a bike, you can climb up slopes!"^Or if you're more of the acrobatic type, you might want to try riding on top of railings!"/This is \PN, reporting on the latest news!"... Better get going!"+It's a poster for "Trainer x Trainer"!"7Do you know about the \C[1]Wallpaper Lottery\C[0]?"�It's a new promotion we're doing for our "Talk of the Town" TV show! We want to encourage Trainers to fill out their Quest Log App!"Every Quest you complete gives you a \C[1]Quest Point\C[0] that you can then spend to obtain a new \C[1]PC Box Background\C[0]!"RIsn't that fun? You can access it from any PC. Feel free to try it over here!")\C[3]Unlocked the Wallpaper Lottery!"WYou're awarded one Quest Point for every quest you complete in your Quest Log App."^You can access the Wallpaper Lottery from any PC to spend them on new PC Box backgrounds!":Now, where do I go to find the Game Corner from here?"(Bicycles have two different speeds!"@Some prefer maneuverability while others prefer pure speed!"7Heyah! Do you know about the move \C[1]\V[4]\C[0]?"tIt allows you to swap abilities with your target! It can be pretty powerful if you're clever with your fusions."CWant me to demonstrate some of my favorite strategies with it?"7Woah! You totally outsmarted my clever strategies!"I'll keep my secrets then!"[A deal's a deal! I'll teach the move \C[1]\V[4]\C[0] to any of your Pokémon for free!"ODone! I hope you come up with a bunch of clever strategies with this move!"As you wish!".A poster for the "Mirage Detection Unit"!"(Eek! I saw a Rattata in the tunnel!"RIt's the scheduling for next week's broadcast! When is Hoenn Rangers playing?"3It's the scheduling for next week's broadcast!"pWelcome to the Poké Ball Workshop. We can swap the Poké Ball your Pokémon was caught in for another one."HThe cost is $3000 per Pokémon. Would you like to use our services?"#You don't have enough money..."Please come again!"Pokéball Workshop"JExperience cannot be created out of nothing, nor can it be destroyed."1But it can be transfered using Exp. Candies!"AHmm... Mauville is really big, huh? I hope I don't get lost."aWelcome to the Pokéball Worksho