rass-type moves..."�But Roxanne is a smart student! She knows how to fuse Pokémon to cover their weaknesses, so you have to be prepared for anything!";Take this in case your battle with her gets too tough!"~This Gym is a full on excavation site! Roxanne, the Gym Leader here, used it to unearth her powerful \V[5]-type Pokémon!"G\V[5]-type Pokémon are weak against Water and Grass type moves..."FWhoa! What a breathtaking victory!\nMy cheering must have worked."{You know, every champion needs a fitting hairstyle. I'll give you a new haircut to celebrate your victory if you want!"What would you like to do?"2Keep going! I can see great potential in you!"'I still have much to learn myself."GThe trick to becoming good at something is to never stop learning!"It's a Pokémon fossil!";Hello, I am Roxanne, the Rustboro Pokémon Gym Leader."iI became a Gym Leader so that I might apply what I learned at the Pokémon Trainer School in battle."~Pokémon League rules state that a challenger can only bring the same number of Pokémon as the Gym Leader into a battle."OI have two Pokémon on my team, so that means you can also only bring two."JWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle, and with which Pokémon?"lThe Pokémon League's rules state that Trainers are to be given this badge if they defeat a Gym Leader."<Please accept the official Pokémon League Stone Badge."Stone Badge"SThe Stone Badge enables our Pokémon to use the HM move Cut outside of battle."$Please take this with you, too."sThat TM contains \C[1]Rock Tomb\C[0]. It not only inflicts damage by dropping rocks, but it also lowers Speed."kYou can use TMs to instantly teach a move to Pokémon, and it can be reused as many times as you like."zSince you're strong, you should challenge other Gym Leaders. By battling many trainers, you should learn many things."-And this is another little gift from me."-\C[3]\PN obtained 1 Wonder Trade ticket!"2Come back when you are ready to challenge me!"=By battling many trainers, you should learn many things.[-"&看来你还真有机会赢呢...">哇！你竟然轻轻松松就突破了杜娟的防线！"#真是一场精彩的对战！",连杜娟都被你好好上了一课！"8不过，杜娟还是会把你打得落花流水！"A我要更加努力学习，争取也能像你一样战斗！"哟，最近怎么样？"2听我说，朋友！你想成为冠军吗？"J我虽然不是训练家，但绝对能给你一些制胜的建议。"J那就这么决定了！一起朝着宝可梦联盟冠军努力吧！"�这座道馆本身就是一处挖掘现场！这里的道馆馆主杜娟，就是在这里发掘出她强大的\V[5]属性宝可梦的！"@\V[5]属性宝可梦被水属性和草属性招式克制..."�不过杜娟可是个聪明的优等生！她懂得利用融合来弥补宝可梦的弱点，所以你可要做好万全准备！"A拿着这个，如果和她的对战太艰难就用上吧！"�这座道馆本身就是一座挖掘现场！这里的道馆馆主杜娟，就是在这里发掘出她强大的\V[5]属性宝可梦的！"=\V[5]属性宝可梦弱于水属性和草属性招式..."U哇！真是一场激动人心的胜利！\n一定是我的加油起作用了。"�你知道吗，每位冠军都需要一个与之相称的发型。如果你愿意，我可以免费帮你换个新发型来庆祝你的胜利！"要做什么？"A继续努力吧！我看得出来，你有巨大的潜力！"5我自己也还有很多需要学习的地方。"J想要真正精通一件事，秘诀就是永远不要停止学习！"#这是一块宝可梦化石！">你好，我是卡那兹宝可梦道馆馆主，杜娟。"q我成为道馆馆主，就是为了能把我在宝可梦训练家学校学到的知识运用到对战中。"n根据宝可梦联盟的规则，挑战者在道馆战中只能携带与馆主相同数量的宝可梦。"J我的队伍中有两只宝可梦，所以你也只能派出两只。"_那么，请让我见识一下你的战斗方式，以及你会派出哪些宝可梦吧。"\根据宝可梦联盟的规定，击败道馆馆主的训练家将获得这枚徽章。";请收下这枚宝可梦联盟官方的岩石徽章。"岩石徽章"h拥有岩石徽章后，你的宝可梦就可以在对战外使用秘传招式「居合劈」了。" 这个也请一起收下。"~这个招式学习器记录的是\C[1]岩石封锁\C[0]。它不仅能落石造成伤害，还能降低对手的速度。"_招式学习器可以立即让宝可梦学会招式，而且可以无限次重复使用。"�既然你拥有这样的实力，就去挑战其他道馆馆主吧。与更多训练家交手，你一定能学到更多东西。"8另外，这也是我送给你的一点小礼物。",\C[3]\PN获得了1张奇迹交换券！"2等你准备好了，再回来挑战我吧！"A与更多训练家交手，你一定能学到更多东西。;[-"*Maybe you stand a chance after all..."CWoah! You blew through Roxanne's defenses like it was nothing!"That was an awesome fight!"Even Roxanne got schooled!"'Still, Roxanne will pulverize you!":I'm going to study hard so that I can fight like you!"Yo, how's it going?">Listen, my friend! Would you like to become the Champion?"DI'm no Trainer, not me, but I can sure give you winning advice."LThat's settled, then! We'll aim for the Pokémon Championship together!"~This Gym is a full-on excavation site! Roxanne, the Gym Leader here, used it to unearth her powerful \V[5]-type Pokémon!"H\V[5]-type Pokémon are weak against Water- and Grass-type moves..."�But Roxanne is a smart student! She knows how to fuse Pokémon to cover their weaknesses, so you have to be prepared for anything!";Take this in case your battle with her gets too tough!"~This Gym is a full on excavation site! Roxanne, the Gym Leader here, used it to unearth her powerf