form!"nThere should be an extra uniform in this box. Put it on and go see if some of the other grunts need help.")Huh? You're done with your training?"HWell... I guess you're officially part of Team Magma now, congrats!""That's great timing actually."�I sent one of the grunts to scout the area when we set up camp here and he said he spotted some \C[2]Slugma Eggs\C[0] not too far."uNow that things have calmed down a bit, we should go collect them. Slugma's the perfect Pokémon for us to fuse!"@I'll need a hand though, so you're coming along. Follow me!"=Listen, you gotta wear your uniform when you're on duty."+Hot as a... Slugma? Meh, I don't know."Fierce as a ... Numel?"$Ehh... Or maybe hot as a Numel?",No, we need to find something punchier!"%Oh, hey. It's the new recruit..."jTabitha tasked us with coming up with an official theme song for Team Magma. Maybe you can help us..."KIt needs to make us sound tough and intimidating. You got inspiration?"Let's get to work then!"7Yeah... I didn't expect much from a newbie anyway."+Huh? Who are you? Where's you uniform?"Can't you see we're busy?"1You're gonna help us compose the theme song?",There we have it. That's the full song!"3Oh, that's good! Maxie's gonna be proud of us!"+Alright, here's for your contribution!"You said you would!"UThere's a pile of Team Magma uniforms. It looks like they've been worn before..."%Use the \C[2]Magma Uniform\C[0]?"UThere's a pile of Team Magma uniforms. It looks like they'be been worn before..."MIt's a map of the Hoenn region. A few locations are marked with a red X."Let's go!"See ya"Yes"NoIu;␀=[["V\C[1]Before that asteroid slams into the ocean, we'll take the time to get ready."8\C[1]First, we adapt our cities to make them float!"$\C[1]Just like Pacifidlog Town!"3\C[1]Then, we'll expand the oceans themselves!"@\C[1]Everyone'll have to adapt. It'll be a new way of life!"j\C[1]When the asteroid hits, it'll be nothing but a big wave. Our aquatic cities will barely feel it!"[\C[2]The only rational solution to defend against that asteroid is to expand the land!"g\C[2]You see, by increasing the landmass, we'll create a natural barrier between us and the ocean."{\C[2]So when the asteroid strikes, the extra land will shield us from the water and our cities will be left unscathed."Z\C[1]But what about all of the Pokémon that live on land, right? Where will they go?"\C[1]Ho ho! It's simple!"e\C[1]We'll fuse them all with water Pokémon! Then they'll live in the ocean, just like we will."_\C[3]The asteroid would land in the ocean. This will release an enormous amount of energy."H\C[3]The shockwave would create massive tsunamis in all directions."`\C[3]These tsunamis would then hit all coastal cities like Slateport City at the same time!"f\C[2]Of course, this comes at a cost. Pokémon that depend on the sea will lose their habitats..."C\C[2]...Which is why we will fuse them all with land Pokémon!"$\C[2]THAT's how you save Hoenn!"b\C[11]You see, there's a huge \C[3]asteroid\C[11] that's on track to collide with our planet."\\C[11]This asteroid is more than six miles in diameter and it's coming towards us fast."O\C[11]They say it'll come slamming down in the ocean near Sootopolis City!"E\C[11]When it does, it'll unleash a terrifying amount of energy."I\C[11]The shockwave will create massive tsunamis in every direction."l\C[3]The floods would be so intense that it would wipe out entire cities, along with their inhabitants!"E\C[11]All the coastal cities like Slateport will be hit at once!"u\C[11]The floods would be so intense that it will wipe them out completely, along with everyone who lives there!["L\C[1]在那颗陨石撞入海洋之前，我们会做好万全准备。"C\C[1]首先，我们要改造城市，让它们漂浮起来！""\C[1]就像暮水镇那样！"4\C[1]接着，我们还要扩张海洋本身！"F\C[1]所有人都必须适应。这将是全新的生活方式！"s\C[1]等陨石撞击时，那也不过是一道巨浪而已。我们的水上城市几乎不会受到影响！"L\C[2]要抵御那颗陨石，唯一理性的方案就是扩大陆地！"g\C[2]你看，只要增加陆地面积，我们就能在自己与海洋之间建立天然屏障。"g\C[2]这样陨石撞击时，额外的陆地就能挡住海啸，我们的城市将安然无恙。"R\C[1]但那些生活在陆地上的宝可梦怎么办？它们要去哪里？"\C[1]呵呵！很简单！"g\C[1]把它们全部和水系宝可梦融合！这样它们就能像我们一样生活在海里。"F\C[3]陨石会坠入海洋，并释放出极其庞大的能量。":\C[3]冲击波会向四面八方形成巨型海啸。"R\C[3]这些海啸会同时袭击包括凯那市在内的所有沿海城市！"X\C[2]当然，这也有代价。依赖海洋生存的宝可梦将失去栖息地..."F\C[2]...所以我们会把它们全部和陆地宝可梦融合！"+\C[2]这才是拯救丰缘的方法！"^\C[11]你知道吗，有一颗巨大的\C[3]陨石\C[11]正朝着我们的星球撞来。"P\C[11]这颗陨石直径超过六英里，而且正高速朝我们袭来。";\C[11]据说它会坠落在琉璃市附近的海域！"G\C[11]一旦撞击发生，它将释放出极其可怕的能量。";\C[11]冲击波会向四面八方掀起巨型海啸。"[\C[3]洪水将猛烈到足以摧毁整座城市，连同其中的居民一起吞没！"M\C[11]所有像凯那市这样的沿海城市都会同时遭到冲击！"V\C[11]洪水会猛烈到将城市彻底摧毁，连同所有居民一起吞没！;["V\C[1]Before that asteroid slams into the ocean, we'll take the time to get ready."8\C[1]First, we adapt our cities to make them float!"$\C[1]Just like Pacifidlog Town!"3\C[1]Then, we'll expand the oceans themselves!"@\C[1]Everyone'll have to adapt. It'll be a new way of life!"j\C[1]When the asteroid hits, it'll be nothing but a big wave. Our aquatic cities will barely feel it!"[\C[2]The only rational solution to defend against that asteroid is to expand the land!"g\C[2]You see, by increasing the landmass, we'll create a natural barrier between us and the ocean."{\C[2]So when the asteroid strikes, the extra land will shield us from the water and our cities will be left unscathed."Z\C[1]But what about all of the Pokémon that live on land, right? Where will they go?"\C[1]Ho ho! It's simple!"e\C[1]We'll fuse them all with water Pokémon! Then they'll live in the ocean, just like we will."_\C[3]The asteroid would land in the ocean. This will release an enormous amount of energy."H\C[3]The shockwave would create massive tsunamis in all directions."`\C[3]These tsunamis would then hit all coastal cities like Slateport City at the same time!"f\C[2]Of course, this comes at a cost. Pokémon that depend on the sea will lose their habitats..."C\C[2]...Which is why we will fuse them all with land Pokémon!"$\C[2]THAT's how you save Hoenn!"b\C[11]You see, there's a huge \C[3]asteroid\C[11] that's on track to collide with our planet."\\C[11]This asteroid is more than six miles in diameter and it's coming towards us fast."O\C[11]They say it'll come slamming down in the ocean near Soo