ou're shining bright already!"@Buzzzzzz! I can still feel the shock waves from our battle!"6Or maybe it's from that electricity next to me..."Turn on the generator?"Turn off the generator?"DWattson, our Gym Leader, has been around for a long, long time."2What? You've gotten past all my rigged doors?"%Wahahahah! Now, that is amusing!"aMaking traps for my Gym and battling with young Trainers like you are the things I live for!"YNow, I, Wattson, the Leader of Mauville Gym, shall electrify you! Choose 4 Pokémon!"4I was electrified by you. Now, take this badge!"Dynamo Badge"RWith the Dynamo Badge, Pokémon can use the HM Rock Smash outside of battles."GAll righty then, this here's for you too! Go on, take it with you!"KIt's a move that never misses! It'll shock your opponents to the core!"FI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!".\C[3]\PN obtained 3 Wonder Trade tickets!"+Wahahaha! Come back when you're ready!"8Pokémon and rock, it's all about heart, whoa yeah!"=\C[2]This is where the current version of the game ends."�\C[2]You can continue to explore, but any content past this point, including the use of Rock Smash, will only be available in future updates."J\C[2]Please fill out this form to give us some feedback about Part 1."6The link will open automatically in your browser."a\C[2]Make sure to join the Pokémon Infinite Fusion Discord to stay up to date with updates!""\C[3]Unlocked Randomizer Mode""\C[3]Unlocked Custom Starters" \C[3]Unlocked New Game Plus"Yes"No"View Credits"Go to Discord[.",我听说紫堇市是铁旋建立的。"h在我们成为训练家很久以前，他就已经是训练家了。他一定知道很多事情！"8铁旋说他很喜欢用开关设置一些机关。"/嘿，未来的冠军，最近怎么样？"^铁旋是紫堇道馆馆主。他喜欢使用\V[5]属性的融合宝可梦。滋滋滋！"\他在整个道馆里都装满了由开关控制的电力装置！可别被电到了！"拿好这个！"A哇，你可真带电！你给门通上了电，门开了！";让我给你弄个像铁旋那样夸张的发型吧！"要做什么？" 你已经闪闪发亮了！"P滋滋滋——！我现在还能感受到我们对战时的电流冲击！"2又或者，是旁边那些电流造成的..."要启动发电机吗？"要关闭发电机吗？"5我们的馆主铁旋可是资历相当老了。">什么？你居然通过了我所有设下机关的门？",哇哈哈哈哈！这下有意思了！"n为我的道馆设计机关，还有和像你这样的年轻训练家对战，就是我活着的乐趣！"f现在，我——紫堇道馆馆主铁旋——要让你感受电击！选择4只宝可梦吧！">你让我大开眼界。现在，收下这枚徽章吧！"电力徽章"S有了电力徽章后，宝可梦就能在对