ners. It kind of looks like a Medicham's helmet."Slick Spikes"^Short spikes slick with gel, so your hair doesn't fall down in your face while you train."	Afro"dA full, fluffy afro that's big, bold, and impossible to ignore, perfect for making a statement!"Baby Hair"PA single curled strand of hair that makes you look like you were just born."	Bald"OA completely bald look - no hair, no fuss, just pure, unadulterated scalp!"Messy High Ponytail"eA tight, but messy ponytail that's been through a lot of training exercises. It's cute and edgy."Messy Afro"fA flattened afro with an unkempt, rounded shape, offering a low-maintenance yet distinctive look."Bob Cut"ZA sleek bob cut with chin-length hair that frames the face with a sharp, modern edge."Bowl Cut"fA classic bowl cut with evenly trimmed hair all around, offering a neat and straightforward look."Box Braided Buns"VA half-up, half-down hairstyle featuring cute, poofy buns and elegant box braids."Box Braids"6A cascade of long, elegant, intricate box braids."Braided Buns"YThis space-inspired hairstyle combines braids and poofy hair into one adorable updo."Braided Mohawk"GA mohawk comprised of one giant braid. It's very edgy and stylish!"Crashing Wave Mane"6A medium-length haircut often sported by surfers."Ruby Spikes"yShort hair with sharp, upward spikes at the front and crown. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Short, Neat Spikes"rNeatly arranged spikes that look intimidating and disciplined. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Brock."Square-Cut Bangs"dMedium-length hair with messy square-cut bangs. This cut is usually seen on young Bug Catchers."Artistic Waves"]Waves cascading from your head that look almost too precise to be messy. Now that's art!"Buzz Cut"PA clean, close-cropped buzz cut for a sharp and low-maintenance appearance."Windswept Locks"cStraightened hair with a middle part. It catches the wind as you chase down legendary Pokemon."Over-Shoulder Braid".A long braid t