"GA cute, poofy, and sparkly dress typically worn on-stage by idols."Hockey Jersey"JAn outfit themed around the Indigo Ice Beams hockey team. Go Indigos!"Quirky Turtleneck Dress"�A white turtleneck dress paired with unique turquoise bottoms that are a pair of pants and a pair of shoes at the same time. How quirky!"Toxic Idol Coat"VA stylish puffy coat that was popularized by a poison-type Gym leader from Galar."Crystal Classic"AA popular Johtonian outfit worn by aspiring female trainers."Elegant Dress"gAn elegant summer dress with a ribbon at the waist, radiating a sense of grace and sophistication."Yellow School Dress"cA yellow blouse with puffed sleeves and a black skirt, styled as a traditional school uniform."Blue School Dress"aA white blouse with puffed sleeves and a blue skirt, styled as a traditional school uniform."Tank Top & Skirt"OYour favourite blue tank and red skirt that you always wear on adventures!"Long Shirt & Skirt"ZA casual long shirt that's colored like a Pokéball, worn with a black frilled skirt."Red Pinafore"3A bright red pinafore worn over a white shirt."Lycanroc Coat (Hooded)"TAn elaborate, wild ensemble inspired by Lycanroc. This version has the hood up."Lycanroc Coat"VAn elaborate, wild ensemble inspired by Lycanroc. This version has the hood down."Magma Uniform"(The official uniform of Team Magma."Magma Uniform (F)"Maid Uniform"FAn elegant, yet practical uniform suitable for any aspiring maid."Marshweater"=A comfortable sweater designed to look like a Marshtomp."Sapphire Strider"WA sporty, travel-ready outfit that evokes the spirit of a fledgling Hoenn trainer."Fairy Outfit (F)"UA whimsical pastel sweater and skirt that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Fairy Outfit (M)"ZA light pastel sweater and tailored pants that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Mod Dress"�A retro dress from several decades ago. Its square design and go-go boots made it popular with young trainers looking to match their Pokemon."Naranj