t and jeans that you always wear on adventures!"Luxury Suit (Light)"bA sharp, white suit that screams luxury and confidence for trainers who like to win in style."Luxury Suit (Dark)"aA sharp, dark suit that screams luxury and confidence for trainers who like to win in style."Team Rocket Uniform (F)"GThe feminine version of the Team Rocket uniform every Grunt wears."White Rocket Uniform (M)"QA white variant of the Team Rocket uniform that every Grunt wears. Right...?"White Rocket Uniform (F)"Team Rocket Uniform (M)"HThe masculine version of the Team Rocket uniform every Grunt wears."Roserade Suit (F)"1A feminine green suit resembling a Roserade."Roserade Suit (M)"2A masculine green suit resembling a Roserade."Primitive Clothes (F)"�An outfit inspired by styles that were popular thousands of years ago. Just wearing it makes you feel like you've gone back to the prehistoric age."Primitive Clothes (M)"Sandshrew Outfit"�A pants and cape set designed with a texture mimicking Sandshrew's hide that allows you to easily blend in with desert environments."Black and Red Jacket"VThis dark ensemble will intimidate your rivals as you take on the Pokemon League."Slow Suit"SThe ultimate chill costume, complete with a giant shell chomping on your tail."Sludge Drip"EA sporty outfit inspired by the colors of Alolan Muk and Grimer."Blue Snow Coat (F)"OA warm blue coat, red skirt, leggings and boots, perfect for cold weather."Red Snow Coat (M)"@A warm red coat, jeans and boots, perfect for cold weather."Splicer Outfit"NA comfortable, warm outfit inspired by the look and feel of DNA splicers."Black Shirt & Jeans"BBlack jeans and a black shirt with a Poké Ball on the front."Steel Outfit (F)"hA sturdy jumpsuit giving off a strong, industrial vibe that captures the essence of the Steel type."Steel Outfit (M)"hA rugged jumpsuit giving off a strong, industrial vibe that captures the essence of the Steel type."Strapped Dress"mThe soft, breezy fabric of this dress makes you feel like you're soaring upon the back of a Flying Type."Flashy Dress"vA colorful, almost tacky dress that will surely get peoples' attention as you perform magic tricks on the street."Street Wear"vAn edgy, elaborate ensemble. It combines style and practically to create a unique vibe only seen on city streets."Summer Dress"ZA light, breezy summer dress, perfect for strolls in sunny fields or along the beach."Aqua Uniform (F)"CThe standard-issue uniform typically worn by Team Aqua grunts."Aqua Uniform (M)"Fiery Torchic Outfit"#An outfit inspired by Torchic."Forest King Cloak"_This cloak makes you feel one with the forests when you put it on. It resembles Trevenant."An outfit that's shockingly comfortable, considering how stylish it is! It captures the essence of Electric-Type Pokémon."Uva Academy Outfit"RThe summer uniform worn by students of the prestigious Uva Academy in Paldea."Veteran Trenchcoat">A heavy black trenchcoat, often worn by Veteran trainers."Ocean Dress"FA stylish dress that captures the essence of Water-type Pokémon."Ocean Robes"TA set of robes themed after the beach. The pearls are made of recycled plastic."Wingull Sailor Outfit".A cute sailor outfit inspired by Wingull."Yellow Qipao"SA yellow qipao worn over pants. It's popular with fledgling trainers in Kanto."Youngster Outfit"UAn orange tank top and shorts that's often worn by youngsters around the region."Striped Orange Tee"pAn orange t-shirt with a stripe across the middle. It's paired with shorts that are comfy and easy to wear."Printed Tee and Shorts"fA yellow t-shirt with a design on front. It's paired with shorts that are comfy and easy to wear."Yellow Tee and Shorts"OA baggy yellow t-shirt paired with shorts that are comfy and easy to wear."Zigzagoon Sweater"WA warm, fuzzy sweater sporting a striped pattern that resembles a Zigzagoon's fur."Zubat Kid Costume"\A heroic costume inspired by Zubat. Become the trainer they don't deserve, but do need."Short Cut with Antenna"wA simple short hairstyle with an antenna that sticks up like a Heracross's, like Aaron of the Sinnoh Elite Four's."Balanced Bun"UA practical bun worn by ace trainers. It kind of looks like a Medicham's helmet."Slick Spikes"^Short spikes slick with gel, so your hair doesn't fall down in your face while you train."	Afro"dA full, fluffy afro that's big, bold, and impossible to ignore, perfect for making a statement!"Baby Hair"PA single curled strand of hair that makes you look like you were just born."	Bald"OA completely bald look - no hair, no fuss, just pure, unadulterated scalp!"Messy High Ponytail"eA tight, but messy ponytail that's been through a lot of training exercises. It's cute and edgy."Messy Afro"fA flattened afro with an unkempt, rounded shape, offering a low-maintenance yet distinctive look."Bob Cut"ZA sleek bob cut with chin-length hair that frames the face with a sharp, modern edge."Bowl Cut"fA classic bowl cut with evenly trimmed hair all around, offering a neat and straightforward look."Box Braided Buns"VA half-up, half-down hairstyle featuring cute, poofy buns and elegant box braids."Box Braids"6A cascade of long, elegant, intricate box braids."Braided Buns"YThis space-inspired hairstyle combines braids and poofy hair into one adorable updo."Braided Mohawk"GA mohawk comprised of one giant braid. It's very edgy and stylish!"Crashing Wave Mane"6A medium-length haircut often sported by surfers."Ruby Spikes"yShort hair with sharp, upward spikes at the front and crown. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Short, Neat Spikes"rNeatly arranged spikes that look intimidating and disciplined. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Brock."Square-Cut Bangs"dMedium-length hair with messy square-cut bangs. This cut is usually seen on young Bug Catchers."Artistic Waves"]Waves cascading from your head that look almost too precise to be messy. Now that's art!"Buzz Cut"PA clean, close-cropped buzz cut for a sharp and low-maintenance appearance."Windswept Locks"cStraightened hair with a middle part. It catches the wind as you chase down legendary Pokemon."Over-Shoulder Braid".A long braid that goes over the shoulder."Wildfire Updo"NA wild, unkempt hairstyle that resembles the flaming heat of the kitchen."Ponytail Spiky Bangs"hLong, beautiful bushy hair tied in a thick ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Clair."Pointy Pompadour"UA pointy geled pompadour, to make you look like a totally normal academy student"Side Slick Fade"IA short hairstyle popular in Kalos, inspired by Poison-type Pokemon."Cornrows"cNeatly braided cornrows that run close to the scalp that create a sleek and intricate pattern."Dancer"VBraids put up in a ponytail. They flow with the rhythm of the music as you dance."Twinleaf Tresses"eA long, half-updo style with blunt bangs. Popular among fledgling trainers in the Sinnoh region."Eevee Tail"@A puffy ponytail that looks just like the tail of an Eevee."Neat Backwave"zShort, combed back to hair that give a tidy and professional appearance. This style was popularized by Professor Elm."Emo Bangs"_A styled haircut with long, angled layers and sweeping bangs for a dramatic and edgy look."Bandana Straight Hair"vMedium-length hair that falls straight down around a gray bandana. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Erika."Fade Haircut"iA fade haircut with gradually shortened sides and back, blending seamlessly into longer hair on top."Droopy Bangs"mMedium-length bangs that flow beautifully in the wind. This style was popularized by Gym Leader Falkner."Lava Plume Ponytail"GA topknot ponytail that flares out into a brilliant plume of hair."Medium Flareout"_Medium, smooth hair which curls at its endsides, giving a winged silhouette to your hair.."Side-Swept Fringe"KA bold, asymmetrical hairstyle where strands fuse into a stylish wave."Guardian Fringe"OA neat fringe that covers one eye that is styled to look like a Gardevoir."Front Spikes"wSpikes that 