y pigtails tied with ribbons, adding a fun and youthful touch to your look."Pixie Cut"nA short, playful pixie cut with closely cropped sides and a bit of length on top for a modern, airy look."Polished Scalp">A completely bald head with some polish to make it shiny!"Pompadour"HA dramatic, swept-back hairstyle with towering volume at the front."Punk Tails"BHigh, wild twin ponytails bursting with volume and rebellion."Rising Star Dreads"NStylish dreadlocks tied up in a bun. Some hang down loosely in the front."Short Hat Hair"HShort spiky hair that's been flattened by constantly wearing a hat."Edgy Asymmetrical Cut"DAn edgy, asymmetrical hairstyle with a highlight in the center."Combover"eA sleek, neatly styled combover with a side part that creates a polished and refined appearance."Paldean Ponytail"VA long ponytail with spiky bangs, just like the Paldean Elite Four member Rika's."Long Pigtails Buns"An eye-catching hairdo with two large side buns that continue into long pigtails. It's popular with fledgling trainers in Unova"Roserade (Medium)"QMedium-length spiky hair that's styled to resemble a Roserade's head flower."Roserade (Short)"JShort, spiky hair that's styled to resemble a Roserade's head flower."Studious Pigtails"NTwo long, straight pigtails that are secured by a large, fan like ribbon."Poison Barb Ponytail"]A spiky topknot that's sure to intoxicate all who look upon you onstage as you rock out."Bone Braids"mWickedly cool braids styled to look like bones. It's modeled after Paldean rapper Ryme's signature look."Clairvoyant Cut"pA medium-length cut with a fringe that frames the face.The style was popularized by the Gym Leader Sabrina."Telekinetic Tresses"zA long hairstyle with blunt bangs. It seems to flow independently of the wind. Popularized by the Gym Leader Sabrina."Paradox Cut"YA hairstyle reminiscent of one that was known to be popular a long, long time ago..."Samurai"=A hairstyle just like the one that a samurai would wear!"New M