n be eaten is very sweet and delicious."fIf the leaves grow longer and curlier than average, this Berry will have a somewhat-bitter taste."pThis Berry's peel is hard, but the flesh inside is very juicy. It is distinguished by its bracing sourness."ZIt takes longer to grow than Berries such as Cheri. The smaller Berries taste better."rNature's gifts came together as one in this Berry. It has a wondrous mix of flavors that spread in the mouth."ZThe more this berry absorbs energy from sunlight, the more vividly colorful it grows."pThis Berry's gradual process of storing nutrients beneficial to Pokémon health causes it to mature slowly."[Sitrus came from the same family as Oran. It is larger and smoother tasting than Oran."vThis Berry is oddly shaped, appearing as if someone took a bite out of it. It is packed full of spicy substances."iIt is said that this Berry grew lumps to help Pokémon grip it, allowing propagation farther afield."aThis Berry progressively curves as it grows. The curvier the Berry, the sweeter and tastier."kThis Berry turns bitter toward the stem. The dainty flower it grows from doesn't absorb much sunlight."YThis Berry is very big and sour. The juiciness of the pulp accentuates the sourness."rA small hint of spiciness lingers in the red granules surrounding this Berry. Their centers have a dry taste."fThough this small, delicately skinned Berry is blue in color, it dyes the mouth black when eaten."jBitter, but with a trace of sweetness, the Nanab Berry was the seventh to be discovered in the world."sThe potent mix of bitter and sour in this Berry seems to promote digestion. The flower is white and beautiful."dIt is said that when the sour skin is peeled, this spicy Berry can be crushed to make medicine."^When this sweetly spicy Berry's thick skin is peeled, many pieces of the fruit spill out."eThis Berry can be eaten as is or boiled to obtain an extract that adds a dash of flavor to food."dEven in places of constant rain and high humidity, this Berry's plant grows healthy and strong."[This somewhat-rare Berry projects an image of luxury, so it is favored as a gift item."XOne bite of this very tender Berry fills the mouth with its sweet and tangy flavor."eThis Berry is large and spicy. When eaten during the cold season, it warms the body from inside."uIts dryness is quite strong. As a result, its true deliciousness can't be appreciated by just eating one or two."fThe grown-up flavor and dreamy sweetness of this Berry make it a favorite of Pokémon everywhere."xEven though it is bitter, it should be eaten peel and all. The hair on the peel cleans the stomach from the inside."dThis Berry is quite sour overall, with the sourness especially concentrated at the pointed end."vSo spicy is the Spelon Berry that, Fire type or not, Pokémon will try to breathe fire after eating a single one."VThis Berry drifted from a faraway sea. It is now cultivated in the Sinnoh region."qA bounty of nature that is exceedingly sweet. The Berry is huge, with some discovered that exceed 20 inches."ZThis Berry is tremendously bitter. Just one bite is enough to instantly stop hiccups."lThis glossy and colorful Berry has a mouthwateringly delicious appearance. However, it is awfully sour."qThis Berry is said to have grown plentiful in the tropics of the past. It boasts an intensely hot spiciness."bThis Berry's flesh is dotted with countless tiny bubbles of air that keep it afloat in water."aEnergy from lightning strikes is drawn into the plant, making the Berries grow big and rich."xThis berry has a disagreeable "green" flavor and scent typical of vegetables. It is rich in health-promoting fiber."vThis Berry has a refreshing flavor that strikes a good balance of dryness and sourness. It tastes better chilled."]This Berry contains a substance that generates heat. It can even heat up a chilly heart."sThis Berry is a brilliant green on the outside. Inside, it is packed with a dry-flavored, black-colored flesh."XThe sweetness-laden pulp has just the hint of a hard-edged and fragrant bite to it."pThis Berry is said to be a new kind that is a cross of two Berries brought together by winds from far away."gThis Berry is said to sense human emotions for the way it swells roundly when a person approaches."rThe flower grows at the tip of this Berry. It attracts Bug Pokémon by letting its stringy petals stream out."uIt is often used for pickles because of its very dry flavor. It can also be eaten raw for its provocative taste."yConsidered to have a special power from the olden days, this Berry is sometimes dried and used as a good-luck charm."kIf a large enough volume of this Berry is boiled down, its bitterness fades away. It makes a good jam."tTiny hooks grow on the surface of this Berry. It latches on to Pokémon so it can be carried to far-off places."gThis Berry is very tough with a strong flavor. It was used to make medicine by people in the past."tThis Berry can be cored out and dried to make a whistle. Blowing through its hole makes an indescribable sound."_This Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of the sea."`This Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of the land."_This Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of the sky."iThis Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of all living things."uThis is a very, very mystifying Berry. There is no telling how it can be used, or what may happen if it is used."RThis is said to be a legendary Berry. Holding it supposedly brings great joy."tThis Berry is considered a mirage. It was said to be so strong that it had to be abandoned at the world's edge."dA completely enigmatic Berry. It apparently has the power of the stars that fill the night sky."qThis berry has a very dry flavor. It has the effect of making other food eaten at the same time taste sweet."QThe flesh underneath the Custap Berry's tough skin is sweet and creamy soft."gThe cluster of drupelets that make up this berry pop rhythmically if the berry is handled roughly."bIn days of old, people worked the top-shaped pieces of this Berry free and used them as toys."{The slight bitterness that cuts through the rich sweetness makes this Berry a perfect ingredient for adding an accent.[F"k鲜红色的果实非常辛辣，稍带着一些刺激的味道。绽开的花朵十分惹人喜爱。"P零余果的外皮和果肉都又硬又涩。不过，全都可以食用。"\树果的内部有空洞，因此可食用的部分很少，不过非常香甜可口。"V在同种树果之中，树叶较长且卷曲着的，会有比较重的苦味。"A外皮坚硬，果肉多汁。带劲的酸味是其特色。"b跟樱子果之类的树果相比，生长速度较为缓慢。越小的果实口味越佳。"V将大自然的恩惠融为一体，在口中迸发出各种奇妙的好滋味。"P这种树果吸收越多来自太阳的能量，会成长得越为鲜艳。"n这种树果会在自身内部储存对宝可梦身体有益的成分，因此需要长时间来成熟。"q原本跟橙橙果属于同一种类，之后才被区分出来。它比橙橙果大，味道也更柔和。"J外观如同被咬过的圆形果实，内部富含辛辣的成分。"e据说外层有凸起的颗粒，是为了方便宝可梦携带，以此来扩展繁殖范围。"\这种树果的形状会随着生长越来越卷曲。越卷曲的果实味道越甜。"Y这种树果花朵娇小，不太吸收阳光。靠近果蒂的部分含有苦味。"S这种树果又大又酸。果肉富含的水分更加突出了它的酸味。"M外层的红色颗粒含有一点辣味，中间的部分则有涩味。"_一旦咬下被柔软外皮包裹着的蓝色小颗粒，嘴巴内部将被染成黑色。"J这种果实甜中带苦，是世界上被发现的第７种树果。"_这种果实又苦又酸，似乎有助于肠胃消化。会开出美丽的白色花朵。"k剥下带着酸味的外皮后，将里边有辣味的果肉磨成泥，据说也可以做成药材。"w一剥开厚厚的果皮，就有大量的果肉从中迸出。稍微的甜辣滋味，是属于大人的味道。"b这种树果可以直接食用。但如果用水煮干，其精华可为料理增添一味。"\即使是在长期下雨且湿气很重的土地上，这种树果也能茁壮成长。"V这种树果较为稀有，且带有高级感，作为赠礼会让对方高兴。"V果肉相当柔软，大口咬下，酸味和甜味立刻扩散至整个口中。"V果实硕大且辛辣，在寒冷的季节食用，可以让身体暖和起来。"P涩味相当强烈，只吃一两个的话，无法品尝出其中美味。"}在令人沉醉的甜味中，依稀品尝得出大人才懂的成熟苦味。这种滋味也深受宝可梦的欢迎。"k虽然味道较苦，但生长在表皮的毛能清洁肠胃，因此建议让宝可梦连皮吃下。"M整颗果实都非常酸，其中酸味特别集中于尖端的部位。"_果实味道极辣，即使不是火属性的宝可梦吃上一口也会想喷出火焰。"n原本是从遥远的大海漂流而来，不过，现在神奥地区也已经能够栽培这种树果。"s口味极致甘甜，犹如大自然的恩惠。而且非常巨大，曾有人发现超过50厘米的果实。"_这种树果味道极苦，稍微咬上一口，抑制不住的打嗝也会瞬间停下。"e虽然从色彩和光泽来看，它似乎显得很美味，但吃一口才发现其实很酸。"q据说过去能在热带地区大量采收这种树果。令人感到灼烧般的辣味正是它的特色。"S果实内部有一些被称为气泡的空气孔，因此能浮在水面上。"D地面落雷的能量让这种树果生长得又大又饱满。"q它特有的植物青草味会令一些宝可梦产生抵触，不过，其富含的纤维对身体有益。"\涩味与酸味融合得恰到好处，带来清爽的滋味。冷藏后口味更佳。"J果肉中的成分带有发热的效果，可以温暖冰冷的心。"e外观呈现鲜艳的绿色，但切开来一看，会发现里边尽是又黑又涩的果肉。"G在甜味十足的果肉中，能微微感觉到硬度和香味。"_据说是远方的不同种树果被风吹到了一起，从而繁殖结成的新品种。"b每当有人类接近，它的前端就会膨胀成圆形，因此有人说它会读人心。"_这种树果会在风中摇摆前端延伸而出的花瓣，以此来吸引虫宝可梦。"Y因其涩味十足，所以多用于制作酱菜。直接食用则有提神效果。"h据说这种树果自古以来便拥有不可思议的力量，因此也会被风干制成护符。"Y这种树果大量一起煮干，即可褪去苦味，因此也适合做成果酱。"q生长于表面的小型刺状物让它能够附着在宝可梦的身上，随之被带去遥远的地方。"V口感坚硬且味道刺激，因此过去的人会把它用作制药的材料。"\将内部挖空并风干之后，对着洞口吹气，会发出难以形容的声音。"V枝荔果是一种神秘的树果。有传言说，它蕴藏着大海的力量。"V龙睛果是一种神秘的树果。有传言说，它蕴藏着大地的力量。"V沙鳞果是一种神秘的树果。有传言说，它蕴藏着天空的力量。"\龙火果是一种神秘的树果。有传言说，它蕴藏着所有生物的力量。"w这是一种非常不可思议的树果。关于它能够做什么，又会引发什么事，都没有人知道。"k被世人称为“传说中的树果”。如果能拥有这种树果，似乎会变得非常幸福。"M由于力量过于强大，而被丢弃在世界尽头的幻之树果。"V这种树果的真实外观不明。似乎拥有着夜空中的星星的力量。"q这种树果本身的味道非常涩，但如果和其他食物一起吃，会使该食物显得有甜味。"S表面被坚硬的外皮包裹着，内部则像奶油一样又甜又柔软。"k由小颗粒组成的树果。若不谨慎取用，果实会发出具有节奏感的声音并裂开。"b如果剥下果肉，它的形状就像一个个的陀螺。以前的人会把它当玩具。"q在浓郁的甜味之中，能品尝出些微的苦涩。也非常适合用来给料理添加独特风味。;[F"oThis bright red Berry is very spicy and has a provocative flavor. It blooms with delicate, pretty flowers."mThis Berry's thick skin and fruit are very tough and dry tasting. However, every bit of it can be eaten."rBecause of its hollow inside pocket, there isn't a lot to eat. What can be eaten is very sweet and delicious."fIf the leaves grow longer and curlier than average, this Berry will have a somewhat-bitter taste."pThis Berry's peel is hard, but the flesh inside is very juicy. It is distinguished by its bracing sourness."ZIt takes longer to grow than Berries such as Cheri. The smaller Berries taste better."rNature's gifts came together as one in this Berry. It has a wondrous mix of flavors that spread in the mouth."ZThe more this berry absorbs energy from sunlight, the more vividly colorful it grows."pThis Berry's gradual process of storing nutrients beneficial to Pokémon health causes it to mature slowly."[Sitrus came from the same family as Oran. It is larger and smoother tasting than Oran."vThis Berry is oddly shaped, appearing as if someone took a bite out of it. It is packed full of spicy substances."iIt is said that this Berry grew lumps to help Pokémon grip it, allowing propagation farther afield."aThis Berry progressively curves as it grows. The curvier the Berry, the sweeter and tastier."kThis Berry turns bitter toward the stem. The dainty flower it grows from doesn't absorb much sunlight."YThis Berry is very big and sour. The juiciness of the pulp accentuates the sourness."rA small hint of spiciness lingers in the red granules surrounding this Berry. Their centers have a dry t